  "summary": {
    "title": "Professional Summary",
    "icon": "",
    "columns": 1,
    "hidden": false,
    "showHeading": true,
    "keepTogether": false,
    "startOnNewPage": false,
    "content": "<p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Senior SDET with 7 years of experience building API and UI automation frameworks for airline, quick-commerce and OTT platforms on microservice architectures. Drives automation best practices and code reviews across a 10+ member QA team, and builds AI-driven testing tools (LLM-based defect filing, Copilot STLC agents) that cut delivery time by 60%. Core stack: Java, Python, REST Assured, Selenium, Cucumber BDD, Docker and Harness/Jenkins CI/CD; reduced regression effort by 90% across 6+ airline programs.</p>"
  },
