          "description": "<ul><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Automated end-to-end API flows and PostgreSQL validations using the Ekam Java framework for 4 key features, reaching 60% test coverage across the microservices-based Merchant Service.</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Ran Dockerized regression and feature suites through Jenkins CI/CD; owned feature quality from planning through deployment with minimal production defect leakage.</p></li><li><p data-resume-whitespace=\"preserve\">Led observability-driven root-cause analysis of daily stability failures with Allure, Google Metrics Explorer and Kibana on GCP; ran and monitored Merchant Service containers via Docker and Kubernetes (kubectl) for service-failure and DB testing.</p></li></ul>",
